		(at 37 93.35 90)
		(descr "Switchcraft 35RAPC2BVN4 vertical 3.5mm TRS. VN4 CD only: 5x oval PTH slots 0.90x2.00mm (flat terminal tabs ~0.30mm; datasheet round hole is 2.00mm dia — pill slots give clearance between pads 3+4). Pad1 at origin; X from hole-1 centers per VN4 CD; row stagger 2.00mm (sleeve row y=0, tip/ring row y=+2.00). Tip=4 Ring=2 Sleeve=1. Pads 3+5 NC/mechanical on 2BVN4. Same holes fit 3BVN4/4BVN4 mechanically. NOT a dual footprint for inline-3 or unrelated 2+1 jacks. https://www.mouser.com/datasheet/2/144/35rapc_vn4_cd-1311116.pdf")
